# BUY-01 learning header
# File purpose: Defines repository/tooling rules through .gitattributes.
# Learning focus: Repository hygiene, consistent text handling, and small build contexts.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
